      "content": "it just feels like a loop. like i'm just performing a role for a world that doesn't even care. it's exhausting to keep pretending that these things matter when you look at the scale of everything. it's almost like the only honest response to the absurdity of it all is to just... stop. to just stop trying. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
